<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-1484-2-2024-learning-employment-record-ecosystems> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An IEEE recommended practice for ecosystem-scale systems that issue, hold, present, and exchange Learning and Employment Records (LERs) representing education, skills, employment, and related achievements using interoperable digital credentials and shared services." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-1484-2-2024-learning-employment-record-ecosystems/versions/1> .
